  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Refreshed 2026-08-29. Cars.com: 27 total, 16 captured. CarGurus: 78 total, 18 captured. AutoTrader: 55 total, 3 new unique listings. Note: the 2013 BMW 335i 6-speed manual and 2017 Ford Mustang 6-speed manual from yesterday&rsquo;s top picks are no longer in inventory &mdash; both appear to have sold. Top picks weighted by documented condition, reliable model family, and proximity to Media, PA.</p>",
    "picks": [
      {
        "rank": 1,
        "year": 2015,
        "make": "BMW",
        "model": "4 Series",
        "trim": "428i xDrive Convertible AWD",
        "price": 9900,
        "mileage": 119873,
        "location": "Burlington, NJ",
        "dealer": "GTA Motors LLC",
        "source": "cargurus",
        "distanceMi": 31,
        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/451677806",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/08/01/07/10/2015_bmw_4_series-pic-5684629706578939959-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "CarGurus Great Price on a modern F33 4 Series with xDrive AWD. The N20 2.0T is reliable with proper oil changes. AWD makes this usable in shoulder seasons when other drop-tops are garage queens. At $9,900, this is genuinely cheap for a 2015 BMW convertible.",
        "whatToVerify": "Full soft-top cycle; rear-window zip seam. N20 timing chain tensioner (cold-start rattle = red flag). Oil-filter-housing gasket weep. Valve-cover gasket. xDrive transfer case fluid service. Soft-top hydraulic rams (all 4 \u2014 slow movement = pending failure).",
        "bottomLine": "A real deal on a modern AWD BMW drop-top if the top hydraulics check out."
      },
      {
        "rank": 2,
        "year": 2011,
        "make": "Chrysler",
        "model": "200",
        "trim": "Touring Convertible",
        "price": 10342,
        "mileage": 54336,
        "location": "Media, PA",
        "dealer": "Weathers Motors",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "distanceMi": 1,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/4aadd848-6a89-42a4-8206-eddbe5c0cd90/",
        "dealRating": "Fair Deal",
        "cleanTitle": true,
        "noAccidents": true,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/in/v2/e832565d-1390-558f-bdda-d819de108a02/5064d095-60fd-415a-8357-5d6aa4f54495/aNXtlXZf8YSJkhCux5yGMyXPvP8.jpg",
        "whyGood": "Only 54,000 miles \u2014 lowest mileage car in this price range by a wide margin. Sold at Weathers Motors in Media, PA, 1 mile away. Cars.com confirms clean title and no accidents. The Chrysler 200 Touring's Pentastar V6 is durable and the power soft-top is competent.",
        "whatToVerify": "Power soft-top cycle (raise and lower fully). Pentastar V6 oil consumption (dipstick check; look for blue smoke at startup). 62TE auto: any delay or shudder. Door seals for leaks. Under rear seat for musty smell or water intrusion.",
        "bottomLine": "Lowest-mileage convertible in this search \u2014 clean title, no accidents, right in Media, PA."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
        "year": 2011,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "S5",
        "trim": "3.0 Premium Plus Cabriolet",
        "price": 13642,
        "mileage": 69156,
        "location": "Haddon Township, NJ",
        "dealer": null,
        "source": "cars.com",
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/dabcb463-e945-41fc-b07c-dd08637d350a/",
        "dealRating": null,
        "cleanTitle": true,
        "noAccidents": true,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/in/v2/220992f4-6d7b-5a84-999a-0c3c413cdc94/564cee7d-5505-4712-8a54-7f364740f431/TWUJbSHF9Ip8hGWCmQukBmMLH-E.jpg",
        "whyGood": "Supercharged 3.0 TFSI V6 (333 hp) B8 S5 Cabriolet with only 69k miles \u2014 well below average for age. The supercharger is very robust; no turbo lag. The electrically-powered B8 Cabriolet top is smooth and well-reviewed. Genuinely exotic feel for this money. Clean title, no accidents.",
        "whatToVerify": "Timing chain tensioner (cold-start rattle on early B8 3.0 TFSI). Carbon buildup on intake valves (direct injection \u2014 walnut blast). Soft-top motor and all 4 clamps; rear window seam. Quattro/Haldex rear diff fluid service. Low-speed shudder (DSG fluid issue if S tronic).",
        "bottomLine": "The hidden gem: supercharged S5 Cabriolet with genuinely low miles and clean paperwork."
      },
      {
        "rank": 4,
        "year": 2009,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK",
        "trim": "350 Cabriolet",
        "price": 11470,
        "mileage": 65450,
        "location": "Media, PA",
        "dealer": "Prime Autohaus",
