        "url": "https://www.cargurus.com/details/453249815",
        "dealRating": "Fair Deal",
        "transmission": "Automatic",
        "imageUrl": "https://static.cargurus.com/images/forsale/2026/07/12/06/37/2009_mercedes-benz_clk-pic-5147648557516517479-1024x768.jpeg",
        "whyGood": "Most elegant-looking car on the list. At 65k miles it's the lowest-mileage non-BMW convertible in the search. 2 miles from Media. The 3.5L V6 is smooth and reliable. No mileage red flags on a car this nice.",
        "whatToVerify": "Soft-top hydraulic cylinders (W209 common failure; budget $400-800 if they leak). Top fabric and rear-window plastic condition. Oil leaks at valve covers. Rocker panel and sill rust check. No air suspension on W209 CLK to worry about.",
        "bottomLine": "The stylish low-mileage pick right in your backyard."
      },
