        "whyGood": "Cheapest clean-title, no-accident convertible in the search at $8,789 with 66K miles. The 200 S adds a sport suspension tune, sportier interior trim, and the 3.6L Pentastar V6. Good Deal badge on Cars.com.",
        "whatToVerify": "Power soft-top cycle: test hydraulics, top seals at front corners, rear window seal for cracks or crazing. Pentastar oil consumption check (dipstick, blue smoke). 62TE auto shudder on light throttle. Confirm S trim (V6, not GS 4-cylinder).",
        "bottomLine": "The budget pick: clean title, no accidents, and the sportier 200 trim under $9K."
      },
      {
        "rank": 6,
        "year": 2016,
        "make": "Audi",
        "model": "A3",
        "trim": "2.0T Premium Cabriolet",
        "price": 12999,
        "mileage": 83000,
