        "dealRating": null,
        "cleanTitle": true,
        "noAccidents": true,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/in/v2/p2p/0cb11156-d4b9-4b04-b292-c2f8153b0994/a868667f-4021-4b17-9e2d-ba6d653f48ab.JPG",
        "whyGood": "Third-gen A3 Cabriolet \u2014 a well-balanced modern entry-luxury convertible. The 2.0T (EA888 gen3) is Audi's most refined 4-cylinder, quick and fuel-efficient. Clean title, no accidents documented. Soft-top is well-sealed and operates smoothly. 83K miles is reasonable for the platform.",
        "whatToVerify": "EA888 gen3: check for oil consumption (1qt/1000mi was a warranty-era concern \u2014 dipstick). Timing chain inspection record. Soft-top cycle; water in trunk or rear footwells. S tronic 7-speed: any low-speed shudder (fluid service fixes). Confirm Cabriolet body style on listing.",
        "bottomLine": "The refined modern convertible with clean paperwork \u2014 efficient, AWD, and well-built."
      },
      {
