        "year": 2001,
        "make": "Mercedes-Benz",
        "model": "CLK-Class",
        "trim": "Base Cabriolet",
        "price": 13240,
        "mileage": 34866,
        "location": "Willow Grove, PA",
        "dealer": "Selden Motors",
        "source": "cars.com",
        "distanceMi": null,
        "url": "https://www.cars.com/vehicledetail/618db3d8-7315-4e33-a78a-7051f0d06591/",
        "dealRating": "Great Deal",
        "cleanTitle": true,
        "noAccidents": true,
        "transmission": null,
        "imageUrl": "https://platform.cstatic-images.com/in/v2/41500c3b-0278-565b-b8aa-8a53ec151e79/b6a20b1a-33b2-4e54-8623-a2400db3503e/KKA8lQVqFTelfR3UEOoMD48kSOU.jpg",
        "whyGood": "34,866 miles on a 2001 Mercedes \u2014 driven an average of 1,400 miles per year for 25 years. Clean title, no accidents confirmed. Great Deal badge. W208 CLK cabriolets are elegant classics. The 3.2L V6 is bulletproof under low-stress use.",
        "whatToVerify": "Long-storage risk is the main concern: fuel system (brittle hoses, varnished injectors), cooling system (water pump, thermostat, rubber hoses \u2014 age regardless of miles), brake calipers for seizing, all rubber seals. Soft-top hydraulic cylinders (W208 commonly weep after years of disuse \u2014 budget $400-800). Check for any deferred dealer prep items.",
        "bottomLine": "Museum-quality mileage on a W208 CLK \u2014 inspect the rubber, not the engine."
      },
      {
        "rank": 8,
        "year": 2002,
        "make": "Mitsubishi",
        "model": "Eclipse",
        "trim": "Spyder GT",
        "price": 8895,
        "mileage": 71811,
