        "whyGood": "Best fun-per-dollar ratio in the search. 71K miles, clean title, no accidents at $8,895. The Spyder GT's 3.0L 6G72 V6 is durable and peppy. Available in manual or automatic GT trim. Pure summer-fun machine with minimal pretension.",
        "whatToVerify": "Power soft-top: hydraulic pump is a common failure on Spyder GTs \u2014 test full raise/lower cycle slowly. Rear footwells for water infiltration. 6G72 3.0L: timing belt service history (due every 60K \u2014 critical if not documented). Confirm GT trim (V6, not GS 4-cyl). Transmission type.",
