        "whyGood": "The N54 twin-turbo inline-6 E93 335i is one of the most rewarding engines of its era. At 94K miles and $10,489 this is underpriced relative to what the 335i drivetrain offers. The E93 cabriolet has an electro-hydraulic soft-top that works well when maintained. 10 miles from Media.",
